# worker_pool_submit — worker pool and work submission
# (README §16). Tests submitting work to a pool.

WorkerPoolSubmit is project
WorkerPoolSubmit module examplesWorkerPoolSubmit
WorkerPoolSubmit target console
WorkerPoolSubmit entry main

examplesWorkerPoolSubmit is module
examplesWorkerPoolSubmit path examples.workerPoolSubmit
examplesWorkerPoolSubmit exports main
examplesWorkerPoolSubmit purpose "Demonstrate worker pool submission"
examplesWorkerPoolSubmit invariant "Worker pools are operational"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async yes
main purpose "Submit work to pool"
main invariant "Pool submission works"

main let poolSize immutable Int64 4
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0

main do printSize
main return okCode

printSize is call
printSize in main
printSize invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printSize arg value Int64 poolSize
